kind: scene
# A scene imports reusable content components (dsl §13) via `components:`
# (canonicalized + cycle-checked + diamond-deduped like `uses:`, §9.2) and
# invokes one with the reserved built-in directive `::use`.
character: demo
season: 1
episode: 2
# The project's content vocabulary (dsl 0.9.0). The importer declares it: an
# expanded component body resolves its `action=` against THIS document's
# vocabulary, because a component's own `uses:` is not carried through `::use`.
uses: ../base.schema.yaml
components: [greet.component.lute]
---

## Greeting by Component

/* `::use` expands the named component's body inline, binding each `@param` to
